IMPORT prelude

-- A trace whose start is not a whole number, over a deadline that is.
-- `l4 explore` reads the start as its clock and explores from it; the deadline
-- then falls on 3.5, which is not a whole instant, and the explorer says so.
-- The type checker gives the start no note, because the explorer does read it.

DECLARE Person IS ONE OF P
DECLARE Action IS ONE OF a

GIVETH A DEONTIC Person Action
one MEANS PARTY P MUST a WITHIN 3 HENCE FULFILLED LEST BREACH BY P

#TRACE one AT 0.5 WITH
  PARTY P DOES a AT 2
